# Source of truth

`docs/PRD.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/DATABASE.md`, and `docs/API.md` decide the product, the system, storage, and HTTP.

- If code, Stitch, or a reference repo disagrees with them, follow the docs and say so.
- Change those four files only when the human explicitly asks.
- A reference repo shows folder shape. Do not copy its objects, money unit, auth, or routes when they differ.
